{%- comment -%}
Defines {{ crop }} and {{ stream }}, the inline icons that mark SNT features
restricted to one kind of tracing canvas. Include once, at the top of a page:

  {% include snt-modes %}

crop:   requires an image loaded in memory (classic canvas or a stream-mode crop)
stream: SNT Stream only

Variables assigned in an include persist in the including page, so they can be
used anywhere below it
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- capture crop -%}<i class="fas fa-crop-alt" style="font-size:0.7em;" title="Requires an in-memory image (traditional image or stream-mode crop)"></i>{%- endcapture -%}
{%- capture stream -%}<i class="fas fa-water" style="font-size:0.7em;" title="SNT Stream only"></i>{%- endcapture -%}
